# Mouse aim oracle, for when gameplay is reachable: the recorded mouse counts must turn the player by exactly counts * sensitivity.
# Check the result with: tools\.venv\Scripts\python tools\test\play_check.py mouse <out_dir> --counts 1000 --yaw-rad 0.000767945
# (reads trace.jsonl: the yaw of the frames before and after the burst; default sensitivity from controls.ini).
@timeout 1800
@warp frigate frigate_start
120
@assert health > 0
@log mouse burst: 1000 counts right over 10 frames
mouse 100 0 for 10
30
@log mouse burst: 400 counts up over 4 frames
mouse 0 -100 for 4
30
@pass
